WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.227 --> 00:00:04.216
WONG
Don't cast that spell.

00:00:04.266 --> 00:00:05.528
It's too dangerous.

00:00:05.578 --> 00:00:06.255
DR. STEPHEN STRANGE
Why?

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:08.967
We tampered with
the stability of spacetime.

00:00:09.859 --> 00:00:11.402
The Multiverse...

00:00:11.453 --> 00:00:14.828
...is a concept about which
we know frighteningly little.

00:00:16.789 --> 00:00:18.589
MORDO
Your desecration of reality...

00:00:20.198 --> 00:00:21.688
...will not go unpunished.

00:00:22.339 --> 00:00:25.734
♪♪

00:00:27.253 --> 00:00:28.904
DR. STEPHEN STRANGE
It was the only way.

00:00:33.761 --> 00:00:38.378
But I never meant
for any of this to happen.

00:00:39.159 --> 00:00:40.915
♪♪

00:00:40.965 --> 00:00:41.761
[Raven hisses]

00:00:52.909 --> 00:00:54.713
[Birds chirping]

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.023
♪♪

00:00:56.073 --> 00:00:56.820
[Shears snipping]

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:57.766
DR. STEPHEN STRANGE
Wanda.

00:01:00.276 --> 00:01:01.578
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Well, I knew sooner or later

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:02.604
you'd show up.

00:01:03.909 --> 00:01:07.000
I made mistakes
and people were hurt.

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:09.444
DR. STEPHEN STRANGE
I'm not here to talk about Westview.

00:01:10.128 --> 00:01:11.586
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Then what are you here for?

00:01:11.636 --> 00:01:12.823
DR. STEPHEN STRANGE
We need your help.

00:01:14.034 --> 00:01:15.200
WANDA MAXIMOFF
With what?

00:01:15.346 --> 00:01:16.601
DR. STEPHEN STRANGE
What do you know about the Multiverse?

00:01:16.651 --> 00:01:19.746
♪♪

00:01:26.135 --> 00:01:27.629
MORDO
I'm sorry, Stephen.

00:01:29.549 --> 00:01:31.752
I hope you understand.

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:39.081
The greatest threat
to our universe...

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:48.567
...is you.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:53.906
DR. STEPHEN STRANGE
Things just got out of hand.

00:01:59.422 --> 00:02:03.165
♪♪

